        "title": "Objective",
        "htmlContent": "<ul class=\"mb-4 space-y-2 pl-5 list-disc\">\n<li class=\"mb-1 hover:text-dr-amber-deep transition-colors duration-200\" style=\"color: var(--dr-text-muted);\"><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"color: var(--dr-text);\">Clearly state the purpose of this work</strong></li>\n<li class=\"mb-1 hover:text-dr-amber-deep transition-colors duration-200\" style=\"color: var(--dr-text-muted);\"><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"color: var(--dr-text);\">Define the problem you’re solving</strong></li>\n</ul>"
